 =========================================================
   CSS NOTES: Pseudo-Elements Styling

   Pseudo-elements are used to style specific parts of an element.
   They start with double colon (::)

   ---------------------------------------------------------
   ::first-line
   ---------------------------------------------------------
   Styles ONLY the first line of a block-level element.
   Depends on screen size and font size.

   Example:
   p::first-line {
     color: blue;
     font-weight: bold;
   }

   ---------------------------------------------------------
   ::first-letter
   ---------------------------------------------------------
   Styles ONLY the first letter of a block-level element.

   Example:
   p::first-letter {
     font-size: 32px;
     color: red;
   }

   ---------------------------------------------------------
   :first-of-type (Pseudo-class)
   ---------------------------------------------------------
   Selects the first element of its type among siblings.

   Example:
   p:first-of-type {
     color: green;
   }

   ---------------------------------------------------------
   ::placeholder
   ---------------------------------------------------------
   Styles placeholder text inside input or textarea.

   Example:
   input::placeholder {
     color: gray;
     font-style: italic;
   }

   ---------------------------------------------------------
   ::selection
   ---------------------------------------------------------
   Styles text when the user selects (highlights) it.

   Example:
   ::selection {
     background-color: yellow;
     color: black;
   }

   ---------------------------------------------------------
   Key Differences:
   ---------------------------------------------------------
   :pseudo-class   → styles element state or position
   ::pseudo-element → styles part of an element

   ---------------------------------------------------------
   Summary:
   ---------------------------------------------------------
   Pseudo-elements allow fine control over specific parts
   like first line, first letter, placeholder text,
   and selected text.
